# FISHER-VIEW-1: the fisher rule switched on in --play (--fisher-rules on). Tutorial/02Trade01,
# player 2 (its city on island 3), type 810 at the open control of FISHER-RE-3 / FISHER-HE-1:
# origin (243, 216), rotation 0. The click is the footprint's centre tile (244, 217): the original
# centres a 3 x 4 footprint on the clicked tile (origin = click - (d - 1) / 2, site_checks.hpp).
# The hovered hut's readout (inspection.* facts, game.ms) shows a worker out, then output.
# Launch: --play {game}/Scenes/Tutorial/02Trade01.sze --player 2 --fisher-rules on --speed 200
resize 1024 768
wait frames 5
look 243 216
wait frames 5
key b
wait frames 3
select 810
rotate 0
expect title build 810
click 244 217
wait outcome
expect outcome Applied
expect fact inspection.type == 810
expect fact inspection.kind == Farm
wait fact inspection.workers_out == 1 within 60000
checkpoint worker_out
wait fact inspection.out_88 > 0 within 180000
checkpoint output
quit
